## ASI (Assemble SI) â€” module contracts

```yaml
asi/gguf-loader.ail:
  topic: "GgufLoader ASI: load() input/output/error contract"
  file_owner: "brain/master/src/provider/gguf/loader.rs"
  hacedle_delegate: "fem/hacedle/src/x/loader/gguf/loader_std.rs"

asi/candle-runtime.ail:
  topic: "CandleRuntime ASI: inference forward pass contract"
  file_owner: "brain/master/src/kernel/hacedle.rs"
  hacedle_delegate: "fem/hacedle/src/x/provider/candle/{inference,layer,lmhead}.rs"

asi/tokenizer.ail:
  topic: "BrainTokenizer ASI: encode/decode contract, GGUF BPE source"
  file_owner: "brain/master/src/tokenizer/"
  status: ACTIVE

asi/kv-cache.ail:
  topic: "KvCache ASI: prefill/get/set memory layout contract"
  file_owner: "brain/master/src/runtime/kv_cache.rs"

asi/runtime.ail:
  topic: "Runtime ASI: prefill + sampler contracts"
  file_owner: "brain/master/src/runtime/{prefill,logits}.rs"
  status: ACTIVE
```

