## FAN (Feature Artifact Node) table

```yaml
fan/gguf-verify.ail:    "EFC: gguf_magic_check + metadata_parse"
fan/inference-runtime.ail: "EFC: forward_pass + kv_update"
fan/kv-cache.ail:       "EFC: kv_alloc + prefill_fill + token_append"
fan/tokenizer.ail:      "EFC: bpe_encode + bpe_decode"
fan/runtime.ail:        "EFC: greedy_sample + topk_sample"
fan/fan-table.ail:      "Master FAN table â€” all EFCs mapped to crate paths"
```

