## Audit rules

```yaml
audits/duplication-rules.ail:
  topic: "Rules against reimplementing what hacedle already provides"
  key_rule: "brain/master MUST NOT reimplement GGUF parsing â€” delegate to hacedle"

audits/reuse-rules.ail:
  topic: "Mandatory reuse targets in fem/hacedle"
  key_assets: [loader_std.rs, tensor_index.rs, candle/inference.rs, candle/lmhead.rs]

audits/authority-boundary.ail:
  topic: "Brain (stateless compute) vs Soul (stateful OS) boundary enforcement"

audits/authority-separation.ail:
  topic: "CE authority: hacedle owns inference ops, brain/master owns orchestration"

audits/struct-rules.ail:
  topic: "Rust crate structure rules â€” no orphan files outside src/"
```

