## Alpha-3 completion map

```yaml
alpha3_exit_criteria:
  G1_gguf_verify:    "brain/master/src/provider/gguf/loader.rs delegates to hacedle"
  G2_gguf_inspect:   "GGUF metadata KV fully parsed (architecture, context_length, ...)"
  G3_tensor_list:    "TensorIndex from hacedle, CLI 'brain model tensors' works"
  G4_mmap:           "Lazy tensor access via hacedle mmap.rs"
  G5_tokenizer:      "tokenizers crate + GgufTokenizer::from_gguf(), encode/decode correct"
  G6_kv_cache:       "KvCache::prefill() allocates [n_layers][seq][kv_heads][head_dim]"
  G7_logits:         "LmHead forward -> logits[vocab], top-5 printed"
  G8_first_token:    "greedy argmax -> token_id -> decode -> print"
```
